flowchart LR
  P[Passenger browser] -->|HTTPS| CDN[Static web delivery]
  A[Admin / operations browser] -->|HTTPS + MFA| CDN
  CDN -->|Versioned REST API| API[Spring Boot modular monolith]
  API -->|Transactions / constraints| DB[(PostgreSQL source of truth)]
  API -. disposable cache only .-> R[(Optional Redis)]
  API --> O[Transactional outbox]
  O --> W[Durable worker loop]
  W --> N[Notification adapter]
  API -->|Provider abstraction; later| PG[Authorized payment provider]
  PG -->|Signed callback| API
  DB --> S[Search / reporting projections]
